	(text "Implement an IMU as part of the rocket's state estimation solution.\nThe part ideally uses SPI for high speed communication with MCU. \nadd heirarchical labels to break out any signals that must exit this sheet.\nIt is likely that we will use 2 IMUs, one for low-g (most of the flight) and one for high-g (takeoff)\nWhen choosing parts, we care most about the part's g rating and sample rate. Ideally it can sample at or greater than around 2 khz.\n\nBMI270 is strong frontrunner for low-g IMU."
